<h1>Upload farm media</h1><p>Drone imagery is stored in Azure Blob Storage. The blob trigger records an audit row in Azure Table Storage.</p><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><input type="file" name="file" accept="image/*" required/><button class="btn btn-success">Upload image</button></form>@if(ViewBag.UploadedUrl!=null){<div class="alert alert-success mt-3">Uploaded: <a href="@ViewBag.UploadedUrl" target="_blank">View blob</a></div>}